sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Human
  participant C as Coordinator
  participant D as Transactional store
  participant B as Broker
  participant P as External provider
  C->>D: Persist exact action intent + digest + versions
  H->>C: Approve exact proposal
  C->>D: Record authorized human decision
  C->>D: Revalidate and atomically claim intent/reservation
  C->>B: Dispatch generation-bound approved request
  B->>B: Check current grant, lease, resource, isolation
  B->>P: Submit with stable provider idempotency key where supported
  alt Receipt confirmed
    P-->>B: Receipt
    B-->>C: Confirmed result
    C->>D: Commit receipt + usage + outbox
  else Outcome uncertain
    B-->>C: Unknown outcome
    C->>D: Mark reconciling, block blind retry
  end
